{
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.Approach": "The drider scuttles closer, her many legs clicking against the ground."
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.Approach.Text": "[Themonster] readies [monster.himself] and dashes towards you, intent on closing the distance!"
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.Attack.Text": "You are struck a glancing blow by [themonster]! "
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.CameWorms": "[pg]The drider licks her lips in anticipation..."
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.DriderKiss.Text": "Again, the drider ties your mouth up in her syrupy lip-lock, seeming to bind your mouth as effectively as her webs bind your body. Her sweet venom bubbles and froths at the corners of the oral embrace, dripping over her many-breasted bosom and your [chest]."
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.DriderMasturbate.Text": "The spider-woman skitters back and gives you a lusty, hungry expression. She shudders and moans, [say: Mmm, just watch what you're missing out on...][pg]"
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.Masturbate.Lead": "The spider-woman skitters back and gives you a lusty, hungry expression. She shudders and moans, [say: Mmm, just watch while I take care of myself.]"
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.Masturbate.Tail": "The display utterly distracts you until it finishes, and as you adopt your combat pose once more, you find your own need has grown."
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.SpiderDisarm.Text": "You don't react fast enough and the sticky webbing pulls your [weapon] out of your grip, gluing it to a nearby tree. There's no way to get it back right now, you'll have to fight bare-handed!"
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.SpiderMorphWebAttack.Text": "The silky strands hit you, webbing around you and making it hard to move with any degree of speed."
  "Combat.CorruptedDrider.SpiderSilence.Text": "They hit you before you can move, covering most of your nose and mouth and making it hard to breathe. You'll be unable to use your magic while you're constantly struggling just to draw air!\\\n"
}
